The W3C XHTML2 <http://www.w3.org/MarkUp/XHTML2>  Working Group is
revving XHTML-Print <http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml-print/>  to a 2nd
Edition to add XML Schema.

=20

It's a good time to add any necessary errata.  Any errors you've
noticed?  Clarifications you feel should be made?  Additional features
you'd like to lobby for?

=20

Please forward to others who might have input.

=20

Best wishes,

=20

Melinda

